    "TitleKey": "Headhunters_RetrieveCargo_Lagrange_E_title_001",
    "Description": "Someone with a death wish attacked one of our ships hauling some primo product. Our crew on the scene is outta commission, so we need someone to get there fast and recover the stash before those bozos make off with it. Any chance you can handle this for us?  \n  \nLooks like the attack went down at ~mission(Location|Address). Head over there and deal with the attackers before they get away. Then grab the goods from the ~mission(Ship) and take \u2018em to ~mission(Destination|Address). Oh, and don\u2019t be an idiot and get high on that supply, unless you want me to send someone after you next. \n\n- Stows",
    "DescriptionKey": "Headhunters_RetrieveCargo_Lagrange_E_desc_001",
